t3code (MIT)
==============================================================================

Parts of Uncut follow code from t3code (https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code), adapted and
rewritten in Uncut's own words:

apps/server/src/agent/agentLimits.ts: Claude Code's usage-limit, rate-limit and sign-in results in words (ClaudeAdapterV2)
apps/server/src/app/ws.ts: the WebSocket RPC endpoint's shape
apps/server/src/app/shellEnv.ts: reading the login shell's environment (DesktopShellEnvironment)
apps/desktop/src/server.ts: running the server as a child process (DesktopBackendManager)

The Claude and OpenAI marks in the model pickers (apps/web/src/panels/composer/providerMarks.tsx)
are the SVGs t3code embeds (apps/web/src/components/Icons.tsx); they are trademarks of Anthropic
and OpenAI, shown only to name who makes a model.

