==============================================================================
Not shipped: programs Uncut uses when they're installed
==============================================================================

ffmpeg and ffprobe: not bundled. The user installs them (for example brew install ffmpeg) and
Uncut runs them as separate programs. Their licence (LGPL 2.1 or later, or GPL when built with
GPL parts, as Homebrew's build is) applies to those programs, not to Uncut. https://ffmpeg.org

whisper.cpp (whisper-cli): not bundled. The user installs it (brew install whisper-cpp); MIT,
https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp. Speech models are not in the app or the repository:
Uncut downloads the one the user picks from huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp into its data
folder and checks its SHA-256. The Whisper model weights are OpenAI's, released under MIT.

Argent (the capture plugin's recorder): not bundled. The user installs it with npx
@swmansion/argent; Uncut talks to it as a separate program.

Claude Code (the agent): not bundled. Uncut runs the user's own claude command, with
whatever sign-in it uses; its terms are Anthropic's.

